intech, banking APIs, payment processing, or commercial payments systems.\n* Real\\-time Systems: Experience with websockets and real\\-time data processing.\n* Enterprise UI/UX: Exposure to enterprise\\-grade UI/UX standards in regulated industries.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Why Join?** \n\n\n\n* Cutting\\-Edge Work: Build highly scalable applications that power transformative B2B payment solutions using the latest technologies.\n* End\\-to\\-End Impact: Own critical features across the stack, directly influencing product direction and technical architecture.\n* Security \\& Scale: Tackle complex engineering challenges in financial compliance, web security, and high\\-scale distributed systems.\n* Early\\-Stage Growth: Shape our technology foundation and engineering culture while growing your career in a well\\-funded startup.\n* Learning \\& Development: Gain deep expertise in fintech, security\\-first development, distributed systems, and regulatory compliance.\n* Team Culture: Work with a collaborative, diverse team that values technical excellence, continuous learning, and work\\-life balance.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n We're building transformative technology in payments and looking for curious, driven people to join us. Whether or not you meet every qualification, what matters most is your initiative, willingness to grow, and passion for building secure, performant, and user\\-friendly web applications.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n We embrace AI as a powerful tool for innovation and welcome team members eager to leverage it in their work. As an equal opportunity employer, we’re committed to diversity, inclusion, and creating an environment where everyone can thrive."}
